From 5afe923823dbee5d0daed542c858cc42d72c6100 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P4R4D16M4 <patrickheinzelbecker@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:57:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] mtd: comcerto-nand: register the stock kernel1 partition read-only

The PE firmware of the PFE (pfe_12_00_2, lib/firmware/*_c2000*.elf) is
in the initramfs of the stock kernel on kernel1; untrash-pfe-firmware
reads the uImage from this partition.  Appended after config to keep the
mtd numbers; the parent MTD stays non-writable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/mtd/nand/raw/comcerto-nand.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mtd/nand/raw/comcerto-nand.c b/drivers/mtd/nand/raw/comcerto-nand.c
index a437b66..725a4a0 100644
--- a/drivers/mtd/nand/raw/comcerto-nand.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/nand/raw/comcerto-nand.c
@@ -121,6 +121,15 @@ static const struct mtd_partition comcerto_nand_v213_parts[] = {
 		.offset = 0,
 		.size = 10 * 1024 * 1024,
 	},
+	/*
+	 * Stock kernel (uImage); its initramfs carries the PFE PE firmware
+	 * that untrash-pfe-firmware extracts.  Read-only like the others.
+	 */
+	{
+		.name = "kernel1",
+		.offset = 10 * 1024 * 1024,
+		.size = 10 * 1024 * 1024,
+	},
 };
 
 static inline struct comcerto_nand *to_comcerto_nand(struct nand_chip *chip)
-- 
